        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Available 1st October 2026. **When applying for this property, please provide as much information as possible about all applicants. The more information we have the better as we receive a large amount of applications daily**\n\nGet Let is delighted to offer this beautiful, luxurious two bedroom two bathroom apartment to the letting market. Located in the exclusive Farmleigh Woods, a development that has established itself as a prime Castleknock address, this first floor apartment is presented to the market in excellent condition. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises a large open plan living room and kitchen, there is access to a large balcony off the living room with unencumbered views of the beautiful landscape of mature trees and grassland. The kitchen is equipped with all mod cons and finished with a marble worktop. There are two large two double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and the master is en-suite. The main bathroom completes the accommodation and has a bathtub with overhead shower. The apartment has the added bonus of GFCH, is fully alarmed and comes with secure underground car parking for one vehicle. \n\nLocated beside the Phoenix Park and Castleknock College, it is a 5 minute walk to Castleknock Village. An 8 minute drive to the Blanchardstown Centre and 15 minutes to the City Centre. \n\nThis is an exceptional property in every way, viewing is highly recommend. \n\nTo register your interest please email Michelle Hoare of Get Let by clicking on `Email Advertiser` to the right of this advertisement. Please submit a brief application with details about yourself; how many people it is for, when you wish to move, etc. Private viewings shall then take place by appointment only. \n\nGet Let is a subsidiary of Get Property Limited, PSRA number 002324."
      },
